：「典禮即將開始，請貴賓(　)到十樓特賣現場搶購，再次感謝您的光臨！」","n":39,"ssz":"......................................."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[4].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"他不理會旁人的勸告，(　)跨過禁止線拍照，最終發生意外。","n":28,"ssz":"............................"},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[5].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"他(　)球場，赫然發現觀眾席上全是對手的粉絲，心涼了一半。","n":29,"ssz":"..........................1.."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[6].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這個獨居的男人，只因為夜裡貓叫擾人，居然拿了毒藥毒殺街頭的流浪貓，行徑(　)。","n":39,"ssz":".1........1............................"},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[7].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"(　)，我們要乘勝追擊，不給敵人喘息的機會。","n":22,"ssz":"......................"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"下列選項「  」中的語詞，何者使用正確？","n":20,"ssz":"...................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"聽老師說明後，他「赫然」發現自己的錯誤，立刻連聲道歉","n":26,"ssz":".........................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"他「環顧」手機裡所有關於大谷翔平的資料，覺得非常佩服","n":26,"ssz":".....................1...."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"搭公車若看到老人或孕婦，我都會「移駕」，把座位讓給他們","n":27,"ssz":"..........................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"他們用很少的經費蓋出高品質的房子，真是「令人髮指」","n":25,"ssz":"...............1........."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"下列哪一項最能說明本文的寫作手法與目的？","n":20,"ssz":"...1..............2."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"用令人髮指的老太太謀殺案，說明警方伸張正義的決心","n":24,"ssz":"........1..............."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"用具體的事例和鮮活的對話，說明李昌鈺辦案的科學方法","n":25,"ssz":"......1.................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"用李昌鈺和警察同仁的比較對照，凸顯李昌鈺的聰明過